Requirement:
Prices can differ by product, currency, and customer tier. A cached result must never be reused across any of those dimensions.

Code:
public final class PriceService {
  private record PriceKey(String productId, String currency, String customerTier) {}

  private final ConcurrentMap<PriceKey, Money> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
  private final PriceRepository repository;

  public PriceService(PriceRepository repository) {
    this.repository = repository;
  }

  public Money price(String productId, String currency, String customerTier) {
    PriceKey key = new PriceKey(productId, currency, customerTier);
    return cache.computeIfAbsent(
        key,
        ignored -> repository.load(productId, currency, customerTier));
  }
}


